    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents dependencies between instructions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is a wrapper of <computeroutput>SUnits</computeroutput> and its dependencies to manipulate back-edges in a natural way. Currently it only supports back-edges via PHI, which are expressed as anti-dependencies in the original DAG. FIXME: Support any other loop-carried dependencies </para>
    </detaileddescription>
